-- MT2009_PLUS_CLEAR_MISSIONS_V1: /usunmisje - usuwanie misji z listy (the
-- owner, 3 October: "Dodaj mo¿liwoœæ ukoñczenia wszystkich misji dla gracza,
-- automatycznie, tzn. usuniêcie ich jakby ich nigdy nie by³o ... aby gracz
-- móg³ jakoœ zaznaczyæ, które misje usuwa ... (oprócz towarzysza i Cor
-- Draconis) ... nagrody nie s¹ przyznawane. Z wbiciem nowego lvl pojawiaj¹
-- siê nowe misje").
--
-- The player types /usunmisje (or opens the window again): the window
-- (client-patches/client-2.0.30/root/uiusunmisje.py) lists the missions he
-- has open now, each with a check box. The ones he leaves checked are set to
-- their quest's own finished state - no reward, no say, as if done long ago -
-- so they never come back. A finished quest that starts the next part of its
-- chain (set_quest_state(next, "run") - the story, the Biologist) starts it
-- here too, so the next part opens at its level as it always would; a next
-- part whose level the player already has opens at once and the window shows
-- it right after the removal. The quest's own items (a diary page, a letter) go
-- with it. Each removed quest's letter leaves the client's quest list, its
-- letter button and its arrows at once (pc.clear_quest_letter, engine patch
-- server-patches/clearmissions): no warp, no loading screen. A next part that
-- opens at once sends its own letter as it always does.
--
-- Only the quests of the generated table below are ever listed or touched:
-- the story (main_quest_lv*, find_squareguard, find_brother_article,
-- patrol_townaround), the side quests (subquest_*, new_quest_lv*,
-- new_quest_premium_lv4), the Biologist (collect_quest_lv*) and Baek-Go's
-- herbs (make_herb_lv*). Never: the Companion (towarzysz), Cor Draconis
-- (dragon_soul), the horse, guild, skills, fishing/herbalism onboarding,
-- reputation, quest books, hunting, events, dungeons, Seon-Hae and our own
-- system quests. tools/gen_usun_misje.py makes the table from the sources.
--
--   client -> "/usunmisje" | "/usunmisje lista" | "/usunmisje usun <id> ..." |
--             "/usunmisje gotowe"
--   server -> "MISJE begin <0 asked | 1 after a removal>",
--             "MISJE m <id> <category> <level> <letter text, _ for a space>",
--             "MISJE end"; "MISJE gone <quest index>" for a removed letter's
--             button; the messages as chat lines.
-- Event flag mt2009_usunmisje_off 1 switches it off. Bots never come here.
-- Kompiluje go Dockerfile. Plik w cp1250.
quest usun_misje begin
	state start begin
